    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/c3264409de7a1496daba0ee6aa6e7d73.poster.avif?t=1724953016\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/c3264409de7a1496daba0ee6aa6e7d73.webm?t=1724953016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/c3264409de7a1496daba0ee6aa6e7d73.mp4?t=1724953016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/1885e42ab49a95e744c9437d9a03ab10.poster.avif?t=1724953016\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/1885e42ab49a95e744c9437d9a03ab10.webm?t=1724953016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/1885e42ab49a95e744c9437d9a03ab10.mp4?t=1724953016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on a classic survival horror experience where you unlock new areas, solve puzzles and discover mysteries!<br><br>Engage in a deep narrative-focused adventure full of conflict and exploration as you play as Caradine, a young operative in a deadly mission for her homeland.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/207324d7744764a15f9de4eb0e107ea9.poster.avif?t=1724953016\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/207324d7744764a15f9de4eb0e107ea9.webm?t=1724953016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/207324d7744764a15f9de4eb0e107ea9.mp4?t=1724953016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/8ed1ff4054bfdf01292470b98bb1f510.poster.avif?t=1724953016\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/8ed1ff4054bfdf01292470b98bb1f510.webm?t=1724953016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/8ed1ff4054bfdf01292470b98bb1f510.mp4?t=1724953016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Twelve years after the War of the Beast, the sovereignty of the Cethra Empire ran unchallenged.<br><br>A team of operatives is deployed on enemy soil to investigate an incident in one of Preven's Gulf platforms.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/fffcf7ad20129170abca8a9c4bb6c609.poster.avif?t=1724953016\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/fffcf7ad20129170abca8a9c4bb6c609.webm?t=1724953016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/fffcf7ad20129170abca8a9c4bb6c609.mp4?t=1724953016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/432017d2a948f0e2e472afc449964e46.poster.avif?t=1724953016\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/432017d2a948f0e2e472afc449964e46.webm?t=1724953016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125300/extras/432017d2a948f0e2e472afc449964e46.mp4?t=1724953016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
